<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E73 Information Object is used as a general category for information objects involved in the representation of texts and their associated procedures, through specialised classes reused from CIDOC CRM, LRMoo, and INTRO."@en .
